      "excerpt": "{\"constraints\":[{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"object\":\"gate_guangmo\",\"relation\":\"west_of\",\"subject\":\"gate_daxia\"}],\"drawing\":\"沿用两门原有锚点，分别画门楼类型；关系卡只标西—东次序。\",\"ellipsis_is_editorial\":true,\"entities\":[\"gate_daxia\",\"gate_guangmo\"],\"geographic_coordinates\":null,\"id\":\"NG01\",\"limit\":\"未给门距、精确北墙线或两门同一高程。\",\"quote\":\"北面有二門：西頭曰大夏門。……東頭曰廣莫門。\",\"quote_is_excerpt\":true,\"quote_locator\":\"原序·北面城门总叙\",\"quote_source\":\"Z1\",\"reading\":\"北面两门保持大夏在西、广莫在东；省略号跨过门名沿革及楼制叙述。\",\"sources\":[\"Z1\",\"F1\"],\"temporal_note\":null,\"textual_layer\":\"传世正文（按所标电子整理本）\",\"title\":\"两座北门的东西次序\",\"variants\":[]}"
