      "url": null,
      "excerpt": "{\"constraints\":[{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"distance\":2,\"distance_endpoints\":null,\"object\":\"gate_qingyang\",\"relation\":\"outside_gate\",\"subject\":\"v2_pingdeng\",\"unit\":\"里\"},{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"object\":\"road_qingyang\",\"relation\":\"north_of\",\"subject\":\"v2_pingdeng\"},{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"object\":\"li_xiaojing\",\"relation\":\"within\",\"subject\":\"v2_pingdeng\"},{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"mapped_entity_added\":false,\"object\":null,\"object_label\":\"广平武穆王怀宅（平等寺条）\",\"relation\":\"converted_from\",\"subject\":\"v2_pingdeng\"}],\"drawing\":\"保留平等的原寺院锚点，与城西大觉独立；类型符不含晚出的五层塔，不把平台复道画成已知院落尺度。\",\"ellipsis_is_editorial\":true,\"entities\":[\"v2_pingdeng\",\"gate_qingyang\",\"road_qingyang\",\"li_xiaojing\",\"w_dajue\"],\"geographic_coordinates\":null,\"id\":\"EO09\",\"identity_policy\":\"retain_existing_east_west_records_without_merging_same_patron_residences\",\"limit\":\"舍宅所立没有在此句给出具体年月；不能把广平王谥号出现视作寺必在其死后建成，也不能据同人宅名合并东西两点。\",\"quote\":\"平等寺，廣平武穆王懷捨宅所立也。……在青陽門外二里御道北，所謂孝敬里也。\",\"quote_is_excerpt\":true,\"quote_locator\":\"卷二·平等寺首段；Z2 p0123a06；F2同条\",\"quote_source\":\"Z2\",\"reading\":\"平等寺继承本条广平武穆王怀宅叙事，位于青阳门外二里、御道北、孝敬里。城西大觉也有广平王宅前身记载；同一主人或同类前身不提供两处同址证据。\",\"source_region\":\"R09\",\"sources\":[\"Z2\",\"F2\"],\"temporal_note\":\"寺院盛时依据见EO10；五层塔另见EO11，不能由舍宅句合并两种时层。\",\"textual_layer\":\"古籍正文短引（按所标电子整理本，夹注分离）\",\"title\":\"平等：孝敬里旧宅改寺与两里道北\",\"variants\":[]}"
