      "excerpt": "{\"baoming_at_ward_northwest_corner_established\":false,\"constraints\":[{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"distance\":3,\"distance_endpoints\":null,\"object\":\"gate_qingyang\",\"relation\":\"outside_gate\",\"subject\":\"li_xiaoyi\",\"unit\":\"里\"},{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"object\":\"road_qingyang\",\"relation\":\"north_of\",\"subject\":\"li_xiaoyi\"},{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"object\":\"li_xiaoyi\",\"relation\":\"northwest_corner_of\",\"subject\":\"tomb_suqin\"},{\"basis\":\"direct\",\"object\":\"tomb_suqin\",\"relation\":\"near\",\"subject\":\"v2_baoming\"},{\"basis\":\"contextual_reading_of_tomb_side_temple\",\"object\":\"li_xiaoyi\",\"relation\":\"within\",\"subject\":\"v2_baoming\"}],\"drawing\":\"苏秦冢可在既有节点改为传称冢类型，宝明仍在既有点；关系板用冢位于里西北角、寺邻冢两种不同关系，不把寺安到角点。\",\"ellipsis_is_editorial\":false,\"entities\":[\"li_xiaoyi\",\"gate_qingyang\",\"road_qingyang\",\"tomb_suqin\",\"v2_baoming\"],\"geographic_coordinates\":null,\"id\":\"EO14\",\"limit\":\"冢旁不指定东南西北，不证明寺院占据里西北角；三里不能变成宝明寺点到门的精确距离，不补墓室、墓道、封土边界。\",\"non_entailment_constraints\":[{\"basis\":\"not_established\",\"object\":\"li_xiaoyi\",\"relation\":\"northwest_corner_of\",\"subject\":\"v2_baoming\"}],\"non_entailments\":[\"宝明寺正占孝义里西北角\",\"宝明寺在苏秦冢某一确定方向\",\"宝明寺到青阳门准确三里\"],\"northwest_corner_applies_to\":\"tomb_suqin\",\"quote\":\"出青陽門外三里，御道北有孝義里。里西北角有蘇秦冢，冢旁有寶明寺。\",\"quote_is_excerpt\":true,\"quote_locator\":\"卷二·景宁寺条后孝义里、苏秦冢、宝明寺段；Z2 p0132a08；F2同段\",\"quote_source\":\"Z2\",\"reading\":\"三里、道北首先定位孝义里；西北角直接修饰苏秦冢，宝明只记冢旁。传称苏秦并未给出经现代考古核实的墓主身份。\",\"source_region\":\"R09\",\"sources\":[\"Z2\",\"F2\"],\"temporal_note\":null,\"tex"
