      "excerpt": "{\"adjacency_between_wards_established\":false,\"constraints\":[{\"basis\":\"direct_group_text\",\"object\":\"bridge_yong\",\"relation\":\"south_of\",\"subject\":\"fang_whiteelephant\"},{\"basis\":\"direct_group_text\",\"object\":\"bridge_yong\",\"relation\":\"south_of\",\"subject\":\"fang_lion\"},{\"basis\":\"direct_group_text\",\"object\":\"road_siyi\",\"relation\":\"east_of\",\"subject\":\"fang_whiteelephant\"},{\"basis\":\"direct_group_text\",\"object\":\"road_siyi\",\"relation\":\"east_of\",\"subject\":\"fang_lion\"}],\"drawing\":\"保留二坊共用的既有群组阅读锚点，以道东二坊〔分时〕及文本卡片表达；不拆两个独立落点、不画实测坊墙或两座同时养兽的院落。\",\"ellipsis_is_editorial\":false,\"entities\":[\"fang_whiteelephant\",\"fang_lion\",\"bridge_yong\",\"road_siyi\"],\"geographic_coordinates\":null,\"id\":\"LR12\",\"internal_order\":null,\"limit\":\"正文此处只列坊名，实际动物到京和迁入的时间还要分别读下文；路侧关系也不能外推给前文四通市。\",\"new_independent_anchor_allowed\":false,\"quote\":\"永橋南道東有白象獅子二坊。\",\"quote_is_excerpt\":false,\"quote_locator\":\"卷三·四通市段后两坊条首；Z3 p0163a04；F3同段\",\"quote_source\":\"Z3\",\"reading\":\"桥南、道东是两坊共同的相对关系。白象、狮子的列举次序不等于南北先后、东西并排或相邻街坊；各坊的边界和内部兽舍均未写明。\",\"roadside_inherited_by_sitong\":false,\"source_region\":\"R11\",\"sources\":[\"Z3\",\"F3\"],\"temporal_note\":\"两坊共同列名不等于两种动物在516—528年同时在场；动物时层见LR13、LR14。\",\"textual_layer\":\"古籍正文短引（按所标电子整理本，夹注分离）\",\"title\":\"白象、狮子二坊：桥南道东的无序组\",\"variants\":[],\"ward_footprints\":null}"
